# `dist/` is NOT ignored here: this copy ships the compiled server as the
# plugin's runtime artifact, so `node dsh-momo-learning/mcp-server/dist/server.js`
# works straight from an install. `node_modules/` IS ignored — the checkout you
# received has it pre-installed, and a fresh clone restores it with
# `npm run mcp:install` from the bundle root.
node_modules/
coverage/
*.log
.env*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
